#!name=One Exit for Surge - Targets
#!desc=仅提供 OneExitTargets 名单，由主配置指定出口并保留直连例外。Mac 6.10+ / iOS 5.23+

# Adapted from https://github.com/wquguru/one-exit/blob/main/shadowrocket/one-exit.module
# Snapshot: 2026-10-23. Local snapshot; no automatic upstream updates.
# Route policy is assigned by the main Surge profile. No DNS settings or IPv6 blocking.

